| `model:openai-compatible` | Talks to any endpoint that speaks the chat-completions API. | `get_model("openai-compatible")` | [`models.available`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`models.credential_env.<adapter>`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`models.allowed_hosts.<adapter>`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Needs a reachable endpoint, its key in the environment and its host listed in `models.allowed_hosts.openai-compatible`, which ships empty, so every host is refused until listed. Refuses a redirect rather than follow it. Defence in depth, not a sandbox. | [agent-runtimes.md](../guides/agent-runtimes.md) | always |
